OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FVideo credit: Southampton FC
OL,9,FSouthampton manager Tonda Eckert has
OL,10,Fapologised over the spygate scandal
OL,11,Fwhich saw his side expelled from the
OL,12,FChampionship play-offs.
OL,14,FIt comes as the club's chairman Dragan
OL,15,FSolak also apologised over spygate,
OL,16,Fwhile backing manager Eckert and
OL,17,Fconfirming he will be at the club next
OL,18,Fseason.
OL,26,@wD@Ai
