OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FSaints were thrown out of the play-
OL,8,Foffs after admitting to spying on
OL,9,Fopponents on three occasions,
OL,10,Fincluding on Middlesbrough before
OL,11,Ftheir play-off semi-final last month.
OL,13,FThey were also given a four-point
OL,14,Fdeduction which will apply to next
OL,15,Fseason's Championship.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
