PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FThere had been uncertainty over
OL,8,FEckert's position as manager, but he
OL,9,Fwill now remain in charge next season
OL,10,Fas Saints look to rebuild and overcome
OL,11,Fthe points deduction to return to the
OL,12,FPremier League.
OL,14,FIn a video published on the club's
OL,15,FFacebook page, Eckert apologised for
OL,16,Fspygate.
OL,18,FHe said: "For everything that's
OL,19,Fhappened, I do want to apologise and I
OL,20,Fhold my hand up, because as a head
OL,21,Fcoach, I am responsible.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng SportCWeatherFRewind
FL,383,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38204
