CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,F"I am responsible for everything that
OL,8,Fhas happened in this football club, I
OL,9,Fam responsible for everything that has
OL,10,Fhappened in my coaching staff.
OL,12,F"I do apologise to the supporters, to
OL,13,Feveryone that has travelled with us."
OL,15,FEckert also apologised to the club's
OL,16,Fplayers and staff, as well as the
OL,17,Fopponents who Saints were found to
OL,18,Fhave spied on - Middlesbrough, Oxford
OL,19,FUnited and Ipswich.
OL,21,FSouthampton Chairman Dragan Solak
OL,26,@}D@]i
