OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FChairman Dragan Solak said: I am sorry
OL,8,Ffor how this season has ended. I am at
OL,9,Fthe head of the football club and I
OL,10,Fmust take responsibility for
OL,11,Feverything that happens here, good and
OL,12,Fbad.
OL,14,FHe continued: "Once again, mistakes
OL,15,Fhave been made, and we will learn from
OL,16,Fthem".
OL,26,@oD@Qi
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/14
