OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FHowever, although Solak emphasised
OL,8,Fthat the club accepts the EFL
OL,9,Fpunishment, he described it as
OL,10,F"grossly disproportionate" and said
OL,11,Fthat the competition "loses
OL,12,Fcredibility" when off-field matters
OL,13,Finfluence what happens on the pitch.
OL,15,FSolak's comments come the morning
OL,16,Fafter the publication of the League
OL,17,FArbitration Pane's written reasons for
OL,18,Fexpelling Southampton from the play-
OL,19,Foffs, and deducting them four points
OL,20,Ffor next season.
OL,26,@oD@SiwD@Ai
