OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FSaints were last month thrown out of
OL,8,Fthe play-off final for spying on semi-
OL,9,Ffinal opponents Middlesbrough. A
OL,10,Fsubsequent appeal was rejected, with
OL,11,Fthe League Arbitration Panel's written
OL,12,Freasons published on Monday.
OL,14,FThe 39-page written reasons set out
OL,15,Fwhy Southampton spied on Oxford,
OL,16,FIpswich and Middlesbrough, along with
OL,17,Fwhat type of information was
OL,18,Fdiscovered.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng SportCWeatherFRewind
FL,383,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FThe report also laid bare the
OL,8,Finfluence of Saints head coach Tonda
OL,9,FEckert and said it had been "a
OL,10,Fcontrived and determined plan from top
OL,11,Fdown to gain a competitive advantage".
OL,13,FIt continued: "These junior members of
OL,14,Fstaff felt compelled to do what they
OL,15,Fwere very uncomfortable doing because
OL,16,Fthey considered their jobs would
OL,17,Fotherwise be at risk."
OL,26,@qD@]OUsD@eO]uD@OOUyD@VO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/14
