OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FThe written reasons stated junior
OL,8,Fstaff felt "pressurised to do the
OL,9,Fobservations that Mr Eckert and the
OL,10,Fsenior coaches wished them to do".
OL,12,FIn one WhatsApp exchange, an analyst
OL,13,Fmessaged an intern: "Try and make out
OL,14,Fas much as you can please. You legend.
OL,15,FManager loved it."
OL,26,@pD@LOUrD@aO]uD@UOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
