CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FIt was alleged that Eckert wanted to
OL,8,Fknow whether Oxford caretaker Craig
OL,9,FShort would play with a back four or
OL,10,Fback five before their Boxing Day
OL,11,Fclash and if Cameron Brannagan was fit
OL,12,Ffor the U's, which resulted in a
OL,13,Fjunior analyst intern being asked to
OL,14,Fwatch Saints' opponents train.
OL,16,F"In his evidence to the Commission,
OL,17,Fthe junior analyst intern said: "I
OL,18,Fdidn't really have an option and
OL,19,Fwasn't provided an opportunity to say
OL,20,Fno... I was an intern and was doing
OL,21,Fwhat I was told."
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@aOU}D@QO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
