OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FIt was also revealed that an analyst
OL,8,Fat Southampton was provided with
OL,9,FEastleigh kit in order to watch
OL,10,FIpswich train at Eastleigh's ground
OL,11,Fbefore a 2-2 draw on April 28 at St
OL,12,FMary's. Footage of the training
OL,13,Fsession was also provided to Saints
OL,14,Fand allowed them to predict the
OL,15,FIpswich starting line-up.
OL,17,FEckert was also accused of wanting to
OL,18,Fwatch Middlesbrough's training session
OL,19,Fto determine if Hayden Hackney was
OL,20,Finvolved.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/14
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
