OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FThe written reasons stated the junior
OL,8,Fanalyst intern, who was again chosen,
OL,9,F"felt under extreme pressure due to
OL,10,Fthe context of the importance of the
OL,11,Fgame for the club".
OL,13,FIt added: "He feared that he might be
OL,14,Fdismissed by the club or it might
OL,15,Fotherwise adversely affect his career
OL,16,Fif he did not do it. So, he went."
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@RO]uD@KOUxD@bO]
