OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F382A1791398905
OL,3,CSouthampton manager apologises over
OL,4,Cspygate as chairman confirms Eckert
OL,5,Cstay
OL,7,FA statement by Southampton
OL,8,Facknowledged they "breached the
OL,9,Frelevant regulations" but questioned
OL,10,Fthe composition of the League
OL,11,FArbitration Panel, which included
OL,12,FWinnie.
OL,14,F"What is harder to accept is that
OL,15,Fsimilar scrutiny does not appear to
OL,16,Fhave been applied to the composition
OL,17,Fof the disciplinary panel itself,
OL,18,Fgiven the apparent historic and
OL,19,Findirect connections of two panel
OL,20,Fmembers to Middlesbrough," the Saints
OL,21,Fstatement read.
OL,26,@pD@SOUqD@UO]vD@AOU|D@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/14
